Description: Installer and KDE integration for CNJ's PJeOffice Pro
 PJeOffice Pro is the signer of Brazil's court e-filing system (PJe, CNJ). It
 has no licence that lets a distribution redistribute it, so this package holds
 only the installer and the integration: the official ZIP is fetched from CNJ's
 own address when the package is installed, checked against a reviewed size and
 SHA-256, and kept in versioned folders, the previous one beside it.
 .
 A menu entry, a tray entry that says when the signer does not answer, a
 System Settings page, a Dolphin action that signs a PDF (a CAdES file beside it)
 and the system's certificates added to the program's own list.
